WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.048
The core contribution is LPLR,

00:00:02.128 --> 00:00:08.645
Low-Precision Low-Rank factorization: a randomized
algorithm that exploits low-rank structure

00:00:08.725 --> 00:00:11.199
and quantizes the resulting factors.

00:00:11.279 --> 00:00:18.790
The authors derive rigorous upper bounds on the
approximation error in terms of target rank and bit budget,

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:22.266
exposing a tunable compression-accuracy tradeoff.

00:00:22.346 --> 00:00:26.806
They add an SVD-based variant, LPLR-SVD, and
validate on images,

00:00:26.886 --> 00:00:30.140
embedding classification, and LlaMa-7b weights.
